1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:57,440 --> 00:02:00,360
Greetings, envoy of the Foreign Battlefield.

25
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:04,000
Greetings, envoy of the Foreign Battlefield.

26
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:08,760
The Foreign Battlefield cleanup will now begin.

27
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,320
Open the gate !

28
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,160
It has been 3 months.

29
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,680
The disciples can exit the valley.

30
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,320
Only 1 of the 7 tokens remains.

31
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:03,880
It seems the competition was fierce this year.

32
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,440
This will be fun to watch.

33
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,400
What !?

34
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,320
One person took all the tokens ?

35
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,560
That's complete nonsense.

36
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,520
It's true !

37
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,920
He killed almost all of our people !

38
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,200
He's here...

39
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,360
He's here ! This is his aura !

40
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:28,760
Since you're here,

41
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,000
stop hiding !

42
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,280
Teng Huayuan !

43
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,320
Do you dare to fight me ?

44
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:52,320
He's just Early stage Foundation Establishment.

45
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,320
How can you all be so scared ?

46
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,520
Teng Huayuan,

47
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,360
give me my parents' souls !

48
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,600
Nascent Soul !?

49
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:14,840
How can a Nascent Soul cultivator enter Jue Ming Valley ?

50
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:17,920
How could you improve your cultivation so much

51
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,480
in such a short time ?

52
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:21,080
You are the one

53
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:24,200
that made me who I am today !

54
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:36,960
It really is him...

55
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,160
It makes sense if he's Nascent Soul...

56
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,560
Jue Ming Valley only allows

57
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:45,800
Foundation Establishment cultivators to enter it.

58
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,320
How did he become so powerful ?

59
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:51,320
How could someone reach Nascent Soul so quickly ?

60
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:54,840
It's just been a few days

61
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,800
but his cultivation has improved this much...

62
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:04,560
This aura...

63
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,960
Middle stage Nascent Soul !?

64
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,000
An illusion ?

65
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,280
You deceitful bastard,

66
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,160
show yourself !

67
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,560
He must be too scared to fight

68
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,040
and has fled long ago.

69
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:09,120
He just left a little toy for you to play with.

70
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:12,840
He even managed to fool all the Ancestors here.

71
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,120
Wang Lin, oh Wang Lin,

72
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:17,640
I knew you weren't this skilled.

73
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,240
If you don’t show yourself now,

74
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,400
I hope you won't blame me

75
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:25,960
for crushing your parents' souls !

76
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,160
The Soul Flag...

77
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,680
Stop !

78
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,160
The first time was an illusion

79
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,640
but this time it's the real you.

80
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,600
Wang Lin,

81
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,080
is this all you’ve got ?

82
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,080
Explode !

83
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,400
Blue Ice !?

84
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:55,720
Interesting...

85
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:59,700
Not only does this kid have Illusion City's Thousand Illusions Bead

86
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:02,240
but he also has the Underworld Sect's Blue Ice.

87
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,680
That flying sword is no ordinary weapon either.

88
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:06,200
Although it's an imitation,

89
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:07,800
it's still powerful.

90
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:15,880
The real show is yet to come.

91
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,040
It's now or never !

92
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:29,840
Father,

93
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:30,920
Mother,

94
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,480
sorry for being late.

95
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,440
Explode !

96
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:06,800
Formation, activate !

97
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,920
Back then, you killed my grandson.

98
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,400
But today,

99
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,160
I will extract your soul and refine it in this Soul Flag.

100
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,120
You will suffer the cruelest of tortures before your death !

101
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,280
I, a Nascent Soul Ancestor,

102
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:33,360
was played by a mere Foundation Establishment brat.

103
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,240
The most frightening thing

104
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:37,320
is how decisive and resilient this guy is.

105
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,720
To prevent the explosion from spreading,

106
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,720
he severed his own arm without any hesitation.

107
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,280
If it were anyone else,

108
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:45,200
I would've admired them.

109
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:47,160
But this kid...

110
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:58,440
I will let you enjoy being devoured by your own parents.

111
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:07,320
Father...

112
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:09,600
Mother...

113
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,640
Tie Zhu is unfilial...

114
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,280
Without me

115
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:16,200
you wouldn’t have suffered this fate.

116
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,160
Wang Lin,

117
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,640
look how kind I am !

118
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:25,000
I let you reunite with your parents...

119
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,920
Father... Mother...

120
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:57,750
From now on,

121
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:00,120
your son will never leave you.

122
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:03,840
My fate will depend on this !

123
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,120
Did you think

124
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:19,840
I’d let you use that strange teleportation again ?

125
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:25,960
All 7 tokens were destroyed.

126
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:30,400
That means the gate will close very soon.

127
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,480
That old bastard Teng Huayuan !

128
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,600
The last token has been destroyed.

129
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:36,920
That means the gate to the Foreign Battlefield will close.

130
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:39,920
500 years... We waited 500 years for nothing !

131
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,920
We wasted 500 years...

132
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:44,200
The Corpse Sect's disciples are all dead.

133
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:46,080
That means Luo Sha won't get to enter.

134
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:47,920
So what will he do with my body now ?

135
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,440
Wang Lin...

136
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:51,800
You deserve to have

137
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,320
a painful death.

138
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:59,320
Alright, I'm done playing.

139
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:01,000
I had already guessed

140
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:04,400
that you’d try to escape to the Foreign Battlefield.

141
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:09,080
You can give up on that idea.

142
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,320
How ridiculous,

143
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:17,520
how can an Ancestor like me be afraid of a Foundation Establishment brat ?

144
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,360
Go !

145
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:47,920
Li'er...

146
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,520
Grandfather has avenged you.

147
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:53,640
After his body is devoured,

148
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:56,320
I will extract his soul

149
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:00,080
and make him suffer the cruelest of tortures.

150
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:02,970
So what if it was a debt of blood ?

151
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:05,450
Does the reason really matter ?

152
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,720
The strong prey on the weak,

153
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,480
that’s all this is.

154
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,600
You old fool,

155
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:14,240
we’ve seen this countless times already.

156
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:16,960
Why are you spouting such nonsense now ?

157
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,640
This is the first time in 10 000 years

158
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:24,000
that a Foundation Establishment cultivator challenged a Nascent Soul Ancestor.

159
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,920
His determination is admirable

160
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,830
but his situation is pitiful.

161
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:30,440
We should feel ashamed...

162
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:34,280
Is this what the love of a child should be ?

163
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,440
Father...

164
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:37,600
Mother...

165
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,040
Did I make a mistake ?

166
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:43,880
Heng Yue Sect...

167
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:45,600
Zhang Hu...

168
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,240
Teng Li...

169
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:49,880
Wang Family Village...

170
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,960
Is weakness itself a sin ?

171
00:12:58,320 --> 00:12:59,840
Cultivation !

172
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:02,280
So this is what cultivation is !

173
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:03,880
I get it...

174
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,240
I get it !

175
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,000
Killing intent ?

176
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,640
What is this killing intent ?

177
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:18,790
Father...

178
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,370
Mother...

179
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:22,760
Tie Zhu is unfilial.

180
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:24,880
If there’s a next life,

181
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,880
I hope I won't be your son

182
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:29,360
because I am...

183
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,440
unworthy.

184
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,280
Sigh...

185
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:51,480
Is this !?

186
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,840
Don't you dare escape with my bead !

187
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:12,240
The gate to the Foreign Battlefield is closed.

188
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:16,480
None of Zhao's sects qualified to enter !

189
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:28,320
Foreign Battlefield

190
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,080
Senior Sister, have a look !

191
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:34,800
I’ve already removed half a sleeve.

192
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:35,520
Ma Liang
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

193
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,000
Let's not waste time.

194
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,600
We were lucky enough

195
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,720
to have found this piece of armor.

196
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:41,640
Zhou Zihong
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

197
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:43,760
I had heard that

198
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:46,670
just breathing the air here boosts cultivation.

199
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,440
We fought so hard to get in

200
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:51,500
but we're just scavenging for armor.

201
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:54,760
Don’t underestimate this armor.

202
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:57,920
Don't you see the Giant Demon Clan's mark on his forehead ?

203
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,400
If we take this armor,

204
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,400
we will have spiritual energy for years.

205
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,480
What’s that ?

206
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,200
Let's follow it.

207
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,320
Is this...

208
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:23,760
A spatial rift.

209
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:25,950
The Ancestor once said

210
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,240
that during the Foreign Battlefield cleanups,

211
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,190
the space might not withstand

212
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,680
the battles between cultivators

213
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,240
so it's torn into spatial rifts.

214
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:35,850
If a cultivator is swallowed by a rift,

215
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,740
they will become a wandering soul

216
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:40,200
and will never be able to return to the mortal world.

217
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:41,950
That was a close call.

218
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,440
I'm glad we weren't too close.

219
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:44,840
Damn spatial rift...

220
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:46,880
You stole one of my treasures !

221
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:49,600
Where’s the treasure ?

222
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,070
It flew over there

223
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:55,150
and was swallowed by the spatial rift.

224
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:59,120
A Giant Demon Clan member ?

225
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:02,560
Their people can change their appearance

226
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,280
when they reach Soul Transformation.

227
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:08,120
Maybe he is Soul Transformation

228
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:11,400
since he has a human form.

229
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:21,840
What a pity...

230
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,400
Wang Lin,

231
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,400
I used all my remaining energy

232
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:38,880
to open the gate to the Foreign Battlefield

233
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:41,240
and save your soul.

234
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:44,960
I will now fall into a deep slumber.

235
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,840
From now on

236
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:49,880
your fate

237
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:53,120
is in your own hands.

238
00:16:59,970 --> 00:19:01,850
Killing intent is a fluctuation of spiritual energy around someone reflecting their mental state and intention to kill. The more someone kills, the more killing intent they accumulate in their body and the stronger their killing intent becomes.
You can think of killing intent as an aura around someone that can be sensed by others.

239
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:11,120
I've been walking this path for endless years

240
00:17:07,780 --> 00:17:11,120
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

241
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:16,720
Is it the compass of fate

242
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:16,720
that wrote this outcome for us ?

243
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:22,640
The heavens want to erase your existence,

244
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:28,360
that's the obsession guiding me.

245
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:33,960
Is this the path to uncover

246
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:33,960
truths from falsehoods ?

247
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:39,560
In a world of murk and shadow,

248
00:17:36,140 --> 00:17:39,560
only the flame of truth can light the way.

249
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:45,280
Look at them all,

250
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:45,280
being carried by the waves.

251
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:49,920
Look at them all,

252
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:49,920
being drowned.

253
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:53,240
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

254
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:56,320
I will let the world refine my soul.

255
00:17:56,450 --> 00:18:01,880
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

256
00:17:58,140 --> 00:18:01,880
I will fight.

257
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:05,000
I'll break through the abyss of despair

258
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:08,040
to finally learn who I really am.

259
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:13,400
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

260
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:13,400
I embrace this obsession.

261
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:16,360
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

262
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:19,160
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

263
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:24,640
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

264
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:24,640
I'll still fight.

265
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:28,000
It's hard to avoid loneliness

266
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:31,040
when you are above everyone else.

267
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:36,720
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

268
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:36,720
be afraid of a firefly ?
